{
  "_comment": "Forge OS apps. Each 'optional' entry is one checkbox in the setup wizard and one switch in Forge Settings, Apps (its settings key). kind: flatpak (one Flathub app: forge-apps installs it while the switch is on and deletes it once when you turn the switch off), builtin (part of the system image, which is read-only: turning the switch off hides it from menus and search, turning it on shows it again), waydroid (Android, set up by forge-apps; its menu entries are hidden while off), virt (virtual machines, set up by forge-virt).",
